      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/28/1/266/7",
      "text": [
        ": حدثنا علي بن إبراهيم، عن أبيه، عن ابن فضال، عن معاوية بن وهب، عن أبي عبد الله عليه السلام قال: البخيل من بخل بالسلام."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.basel-kadem": [
          "7.\tMy father, may Allah grant him mercy, said: We were told by Ali bin Ibrahim, from his father, from Ibn Faddal, from Mu’awiya bin Wahab, from Abu Abdillah, peace be upon him, that he said: The stingy is the one who is stingy with (the sending of) peace."
        ]
      }
